<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="248">by Fred W. Van Sant, Star Cuts IV (1992)</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black" x="230" y="266">Released into the public domain in memory of Charles L. Moon</text>
<text font-family="sans-serif" font-size="14px" fill="black"><tspan x="230" y="284">Angles for R.I. = 1.760</tspan>
